#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:4
msgid ":index:`CD Lookup Options <configuration; cd lookup>`"
msgstr ":index:`CD 查找选项 <configuration; cd lookup>`"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:6
msgid "This section allows you to select which CD ROM device to use by default for looking up a CD."
msgstr "此区域允许您选择默认用于查找 CD 的 CD-ROM 设备。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:19
msgid "When the \"Read ISRCs from CD\" option is enabled, ISRCs will be read from the CD during the disc lookup. The ISRCs will be added to the file metadata when the CD is read, and will be used when looking up releases on MusicBrainz. Note that the code library used does not support reading ISRCs from CDs on some operating system platforms, so this option will not be available on those platforms. The three main platforms (Windows, Linux, and macOS) are supported."
msgstr ""
"当启用“从 CD 读取 ISRC”选项时，在光盘查找过程中会从 CD 中读取 ISRC。当读取 "
"CD 时，ISRC 将被添加到文件元数据中，并在查找 MusicBrainz 发行品时使用。请注意"
"，使用的代码库在某些操作系统平台上不支持从 CD 读取 ISRC，因此在这些平台上此选"
"项将不可用。主要平台（Windows、Linux 和 macOS）是受支持的。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:23
msgid "Not all CD drives support reading ISRCs, and some may significantly slow down the disc reads."
msgstr "并非所有 CD 驱动器都支持读取 ISRC，并且某些驱动器可能会显著降低光盘读取速度。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:25
msgid "Not all CDs have ISRCs, and some readers may not be able to read them even if they are present on the CD. It is also possible that the ISRCs on the CD are not correct or have been read incorrectly, so you should always check the ISRCs before submitting them to the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr ""
"并非所有 CD 都有 ISRC，即使 ISRC 存在于 CD 上，某些读取器也可能无法读取它们。"
"此外，CD 上的 ISRC 可能不正确或读取错误，因此您应该在将 ISRC 提交到 "
"MusicBrainz 数据库之前始终检查它们。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:28
msgid "Platform-specific details"
msgstr "平台特定细节"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:30
msgid "**Windows:**"
msgstr "**Windows:**"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:32
msgid "Picard has a pulldown menu listing the various CD drives it has found. Pull down the menu and select the drive you want to use by default. You can override this setting by clicking on :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD...\"` and selecting the desired device from the list of available devices."
msgstr ""
"Picard 列出了它找到的各种 CD 驱动器的下拉菜单。下拉菜单并选择您要默认使用的驱"
"动器。您可以通过点击 :menuselection:`\"工具 --> 查找 CD...\"` 并从可用设备列"
"表中选择所需设备来覆盖此设置。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:34
msgid "**Linux:**"
msgstr "**Linux:**"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:36
msgid "Picard has a pulldown menu like in Windows for the CD Lookup option. If you're using an older version of Picard with a text field, you should enter the device name (typically ``/dev/cdrom``). You can override this setting by clicking on :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD...\"` and selecting the desired device from the list of available devices."
msgstr ""
"Picard 对于 CD 查找选项有一个类似于 Windows 的下拉菜单。如果您使用的是带有文"
"本字段的旧版本 Picard，您应该输入设备名称（通常为 ``/dev/cdrom``）。您可以通"
"过点击 :menuselection:`\"工具 --> 查找 CD...\"` 并从可用设备列表中选择所需设"
"备来覆盖此设置。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:38
msgid "**macOS:**"
msgstr "**macOS:**"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:40
msgid "In macOS, the CD Lookup option is currently a text field. The device is usually ``/dev/rdisk1``. If that doesn't work, one way is to simply keep increasing the number (e.g. ``/dev/rdisk2``) until it does work. A less trial and error method is to open \"Terminal\" and type ``mount``. The output should include a line such as:"
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 中，CD 查找选项目前是一个文本字段。设备通常是 ``/dev/rdisk1``。如果"
"不起作用，一种方法是将数字（例如 ``/dev/rdisk2``）简单地不断增加，直到它起作"
"用。一种不太依赖试错的方法是打开“终端”并输入 ``mount``。输出应包括类似以下内"
"容的行："

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:46
msgid "You need to replace ``/dev/disk`` with ``/dev/rdisk``. For example, if it says ``/dev/disk2`` you should enter ``/dev/rdisk2`` in Picard's preferences."
msgstr ""
"您需要用 ``/dev/rdisk`` 替换 ``/dev/disk``。例如，如果它显示 ``/dev/disk2``，"
"您应该在 Picard 的首选项中输入 ``/dev/rdisk2``。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:48
msgid "**Other platforms:**"
msgstr "**其他平台:**"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:50
msgid "On other platforms, the CD Lookup option is a text field and you should enter the path to the CD drive here."
msgstr "在其他平台上，CD 查找选项是一个文本字段，您应该在此处输入 CD 驱动器的路径。"

#: ../../config/options_cdlookup.rst:52
msgid "Note that the code library used does not support reading ISRCs from CDs on some operating system platforms, so this option will not be available on those platforms."
msgstr ""
"请注意，所使用的代码库在某些操作系统平台上不支持从 CD 中读取 ISRC，因此在这些"
"平台上此选项将不可用。"
